<title>NETHERLANDS: MONTELL Q2 OPERATING PROFIT DOWN.</title>
<headline>MONTELL Q2 OPERATING PROFIT DOWN.</headline>
<text>
<p>HOOFDDORP, Netherlands, Aug 7 (Reuter) Second quarter to end June 1997 (in millions of U.S. dollars unless stated otherwise):</p>
<p>    Operating result    76     vs    99</p>
<p>    Net sales revenue   999    vs   929</p>
<p>    Gross profit	  182    vs   201</p>
<p>Montell's share in operating</p>
<p>    results of associates*    9     vs    14</p>
<p>* (not included above)</p>
<p>-- NOTE: Hoofddorp-based Montell Polyolefins is a polypropylene and polyethylene joint venture between Royal Dutch/Shell and Italy's Montedison</p>
</text>
